    "text": "MaxPreps\nwebsite\nBlooming Prairie\nVolleyball Recap: Southland Wins Going Away Against Blooming Prairie\nBy Team Reports,\n1 days agoSouthland hadn't done well against Blooming Prairie recently (they were 0-9 in their previous nine matchups), but they didn't let the past get in their way on Monday. The Rebels blew past the Awesome Blossoms 3-0. For the Rebels, this counts as revenge for the 3-1 victory the Awesome Blossoms walked away with the last time they faced one another back in September of 2019.",
